  "pageText": "[Home] ↣ [Privacy Protections Tests] ↣ [Fingerprinting Test Page]\n\nThese checks verify the correctness and performance of canvas rendering. This is to ensure the browser behaves as specified and is used in various identity sites. Canvas drawing is used to visually verify the correctness.\n\nStatus\tNotes\nresistance\tlayering comparison\nfail\tSanity check on pixels that match the reference data\npass\tSanity check on counts matching\nfail\tShould have more than 20% of eligiblePixels that are changed across multiple canvases\nperformance\trandom noise performance\npass\tGetting image data must be under 300ms (14)\npass\tGetting image data must be under 300ms (5)\npass\tData in image must not be blank\nperformance\tfp example performance\npass\tGetting image data must be under 200ms (1)\npass\tData in image must be blank\npass\tDrawing image data must be under 200ms (3)\npass\tGetting image data must be under 200ms (0)\npass\tData in image must not be blank\nperformance\tfp example heavy draw performance\npass\tGetting image data must be under 250ms (0)\npass\tData in image must be blank\npass\tDrawing image data 1000 times must be under 1249ms (150)\npass\tGetting image data must be under 250ms (1)\npass\tData in image must not be blank\nperformance\tfp example performance getImageData heavy\npass\tGetting image data must be under 200ms (0)\npass\tData in image must be blank\npass\tDrawing image data must be under 200ms (1)\npass\tGetting image data 100 times must be under 645.5ms (22)\npass\tData in image must not be blank\ncorrectness\tknown pixel render\npass\tExpect value '18' to equal '18'\npass\tExpect value '18' to equal '18'\npass\tExpect value '255' to equal '255'\npass\tExpect value '255' to equal '255'\npass\tGetting image data must be under 25ms (0)\nfail\tOutput conversion has expected values\ncorrectness\tread canvas into image and back into canvas\npass\tTriggered callback must pass correct key\ncorrectness\tknown string render\nfail\